 "remarks": "Discover the charm of loft-style living at The Clocktower, where industrial character meets modern convenience. This distinctive corner residence at 25 Grand Street features 1,003 square feet of living space, dramatic 20-foot ceilings, exposed brick, warm wood beams, and oversized windows on two sides that create a bright, open atmosphere. Freshly painted throughout, the unit offers a well-appointed kitchen with stainless steel appliances and abundant cabinetry, a spacious bedroom with a walk-in closet, and an updated full bathroom. The pet-friendly community offers an impressive selection of amenities, including a fitness room, sauna, lockers, laundry facilities on every floor, and shared spaces featuring a billiards table and a meeting room with a full kitchen. Enjoy the landscaped courtyard, resident parking, optional monthly garage parking, and additional basement storage available for a fee. Building enhancements include an updated lobby, improved landscaping, energy-efficient mechanical systems, and rooftop solar panels. Conveniently situated near downtown Norwalk, South Norwalk's dining and entertainment scene, shopping, beaches, and parks, with easy access to I-95 and the Merritt Parkway, this unique residence offers a blend of character, comfort, and convenience.",
